Error [E1201]: Two versions of `mylib` are required
 Why: A package graph can have only one version of each package — two different packages require `mylib` at conflicting versions
 Fix: Choose one version and update the conflicting dependencies:
  conflict_root → lib_v1 (1.0.0)
  conflict_root → lib_v2 (2.0.0)
